            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "SnWeO",
              "name": "Closing",
              "width": 1440,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 64,
              "padding": [
                88,
                80,
                120,
                80
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wWJEe",
                  "name": "Statement",
                  "fill": "$text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1040,
                  "content": "Imaginal Airlines is a theatrical journey into consciousness — part airport ritual, part live concert, part guided meditation.",
                  "lineHeight": "$type-display-md-lh",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-display",
                  "fontSize": "$type-display-md",
                  "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "mxoEq",
                  "name": "About the project",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 64,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "lh0x7",
                      "name": "About — Left",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 20,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "PNqPO",
                          "name": "About heading",
                          "fill": "$text-accent",
                          "content": "WHY WE MADE THIS",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": "$type-label-md",
                          "fontWeight": "$type-weight-medium",
                          "letterSpacing": "$type-label-md-ls"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "ZF3Mm",
                          "name": "About body",
                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "We wanted to know what happens when you treat a live show the way an airline treats a flight — with a gate, a boarding pass, a departure time, and a destination no one has been to before. Imaginal Airlines began as a question about ritual: could the language of travel prime an audience to leave the ordinary behind before the first note is played?",
                          "lineHeight": "$type-body-base-lh",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": "$type-body-base",
                          "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "hg6sR",
                      "name": "About — Right",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 20,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "YJaKk",
                          "name": "Goals heading",
                          "fill": "$text-accent",
                          "content": "PROJECT GOALS",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": "$type-label-md",
                          "fontWeight": "$type-weight-medium",
                          "letterSpacing": "$type-label-md-ls"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "B81Kv",
                          "name": "Goals body",
                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Build a live visual instrument that a single conductor can play in real time alongside improvising musicians. Design a system flexible enough that no two performances are alike, yet structured enough that every cue is intentional. Wrap the whole experience in an airline metaphor — from booking to boarding to landing — so the audience crosses a threshold before the show even starts.",
                          "lineHeight": "$type-body-base-lh",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                          "fontSize": "$type-body-base",
                          "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "y1hvRp",
                  "name": "Links",
