        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "K6rqkj",
          "name": "06 · Brand Identity",
          "clip": true,
          "width": 1440,
          "fill": "#0C0C0B",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 28,
          "padding": [
            40,
            80,
            120,
            80
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g8CSX",
              "name": "Kicker",
              "fill": "$text-accent",
              "content": "WHERE IT ALL STARTED",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": "$type-label-lg",
              "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal",
              "letterSpacing": "$type-label-lg-ls"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xCuNa",
              "name": "Headline",
              "fill": "$text-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "The brand came first.",
              "lineHeight": "$type-display-xl-lh",
              "fontFamily": "$font-display",
              "fontSize": "$type-display-xl",
              "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "g7GSjp",
              "name": "Deck",
              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 640,
              "content": "Before a single visual was triggered or a note was played, we built the world. Imaginal Airlines began as a brand — an airline that doesn't fly planes but carries passengers into consciousness. Every design decision that followed grew from that metaphor.",
              "lineHeight": "$type-body-xl-lh",
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": "$type-body-xl",
              "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "ROkxD",
              "name": "Body",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 24,
              "padding": [
                48,
                0,
                0,
                0
              ],
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "R0yK2",
                  "name": "The metaphor card",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#1A1614",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IKOFt",
                      "name": "The metaphor title",
                      "fill": "$text-accent",
                      "content": "THE METAPHOR",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-label-md",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-medium",
                      "letterSpacing": "$type-label-md-ls"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nBRZV",
                      "name": "The metaphor body",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "An airline operates on trust — you hand over your agency, follow the ritual of check-in, boarding, and departure, and arrive somewhere new. We built that same arc into a performance. The metaphor gave us a vocabulary: gates, boarding passes, departures, destinations.",
                      "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-body-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "o0Ol4",
                  "name": "The foundation card",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#1A1614",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "IXuDA",
                      "name": "The foundation title",
                      "fill": "$text-accent",
                      "content": "THE FOUNDATION",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-label-md",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-medium",
                      "letterSpacing": "$type-label-md-ls"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "S29Nja",
                      "name": "The foundation body",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The brand system wasn't decoration applied afterward — it was the architecture. Colours, typography, and visual language were locked before the first rehearsal. Every touchpoint, from the physical boarding pass to the projected score, speaks the same visual dialect.",
                      "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-body-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "W8vAz",
                  "name": "The cascade card",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#1A1614",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "padding": 32,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "zTlqE",
                      "name": "The cascade title",
                      "fill": "$text-accent",
                      "content": "THE CASCADE",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-label-md",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-medium",
                      "letterSpacing": "$type-label-md-ls"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "F0iujX",
                      "name": "The cascade body",
                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "From the brand came the booking website, the boarding pass, the wayfinding, the projection aesthetics, and the conductor's interface. One identity system, expressed across physical print, digital product, and live visuals — all consistent, all from the same root.",
                      "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": "$type-body-sm",
                      "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
