              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 640,
              "content": "The brand compresses into a tight palette — warm golds, deep purples, and signal oranges — paired with a single typeface that moves between editorial calm and utilitarian clarity. Shown here in light and dark modes.",
