                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "The boarding pass is where digital meets physical. Generated by the booking system, it carries the passenger’s name, flight number, gate, and seat — all fictional, all designed. It’s the single artifact that travels from the website to the passenger’s hand to the venue door. The brand system had to work flawlessly at this scale: print-ready typography, colour that holds on card stock, hierarchy that reads in seconds.",
