          "content": "Embrace moments of silence. Use pauses intentionally to create space and tension. Listen deeply to the soundscape and choose when to play and when to rest.",
          "lineHeight": "$type-body-2xs-lh",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": "$type-body-2xs",
          "fontWeight": "$type-weight-normal"
        }
      ]
    },
