                      "fill": "$text-dim",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "From the brand came the booking website, the boarding pass, the wayfinding, the projection aesthetics, and the conductor’s interface. One identity system, expressed across physical print, digital product, and live visuals.",
