                      "name": "Goals body",
                      "fill": "$text-dim",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Build a live visual instrument played in real time. Design a system where no two performances are alike. Wrap the experience in an airline metaphor from booking to landing.",
